[ti:Slopocalypse Now!]
[ar:Meat Proxy]

[00:02.381]Management says coding ain't the bottleneck.
[00:05.200]
[00:07.669]Then what's the bottleneck?
[00:09.240]
[00:14.557]Thinking.
[00:14.780]
[00:27.186]Eyes glazed over in cubicles, nobody's there,
[00:29.600]Thirteen-hour shifts in an ergonomic chair.
[00:32.082]Ticket from a chatbot, specs from a clone,
[00:34.623]Code from a model that nobody owns.
[00:37.061]Tests wrote the tests, gave themselves a green light,
[00:39.261]Bot approved the merge at a quarter past midnight.
[00:41.761]Boss says "Ship faster!" — we say "What did we make?"
[00:44.461]He says "Who gives a fuck? The numbers look great!"
[00:46.942]L-one to L-seven, all ranks are the same,
[00:49.161]Expensive meat puppets in a context-window game.
[00:52.123]Used to solve problems, used to know why,
[00:54.281]Now we watch the little spinner while our brain cells die.
[00:56.801]Ten thousand commits, got a dashboard to brag,
[00:59.441]Production's on fire but the build's got a badge.
[01:01.921]Nobody read shit, nobody knows how,
[01:04.563]Welcome to the future ...
[01:05.640]
[01:06.640]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)
[01:08.780]Brains unplugged, let the bots run this town!
[01:11.984]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (HOW?)
[01:14.000]Everybody ships, nobody knows how!
[01:17.025]PRESS ENTER! (ENTER!)
[01:18.281]Watch the bullshit go round and round!
[01:20.197]
[01:21.841]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)
[01:23.780]The lights are on but the minds shut down!
[01:26.902]Your AI wrote the memo, mine wrote the reply,
[01:29.181]His AI said "Great point!" — no one asked why.
[01:31.780]Four bots in a meeting, not a thought in the room,
[01:34.261]Just a circle jerk of tokens spelling corporate doom.
[01:36.621]Consultant sends a slide deck, forty pages of fluff,
[01:39.221]Client feeds it to a model: "Summarize this stuff."
[01:41.921]The bot says "Brilliant!" and the suits all cheer,
[01:44.780]A million bucks to tell them what they want to hear.
[01:47.602]"AI's just a tool, bro!" — yeah, no shit,
[01:50.121]A tool needs a brain — you disconnected it.
[01:52.602]Confidently wrong in a beautiful tone,
[01:54.781]Hallucinated facts getting carved into stone.
[01:57.582]A polished fake answer with a made-up cite,
[01:59.741]Nobody checks the source, so it must be right.
[02:02.461]We sped up the process, now take a bow,
[02:05.061]Nobody knows what the fuck they're doing now.
[02:07.922]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)
[02:10.222]Brains unplugged, let the bots run this town!
[02:13.163]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (HOW?)
[02:15.282]Everybody ships, nobody knows how!
[02:18.264]PRESS ENTER! (ENTER!)
[02:19.540]Watch the bullshit go round and round!
[02:22.840]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)
[02:23.782]The lights are on but the minds shut down!
[02:28.321]Teacher got a lesson that the kids won't read,
[02:30.821]Kids got an essay that they never conceived.
[02:33.363]Boss got a strategy, lawyer got a brief,
[02:35.681]They've all got the answers they don't believe.
[02:38.383]Ask a simple question, watch the whole room freeze,
[02:40.881]"Hang on, let me ask my AI, please."
[02:43.460]Can't defend a sentence, can't explain a claim,
[02:45.501]But the bot did the work and you signed your name.
[02:48.162]We rent back our thoughts, pay the bill by the token,
[02:50.822]Thinking was a muscle; now that fucker's broken.
[02:53.281]Sold our own thoughts for a shortcut and a smile,
[02:55.722]Up until midnight, watch the progress bars compile.
[02:58.302]Ain't scared of Skynet showing up with a gun,
[03:00.521]I'm scared what we've become, and the war ain't begun.
[03:03.021]No robot uprising, no machine took the crown,
[03:05.682]We handed them our brains, then we quietly sat down.
[03:08.340]
[03:09.527]What is my purpose?
[03:10.320]
[03:12.320]You press Enter.
[03:13.116]
[03:14.620]Looks good to MEEEE
[03:17.030]
[03:18.603]You can own the hammer, you can own the drill,
[03:21.021]But if you can't explain the work, you ain't got the skill.
[03:23.541]The machine ain't the villain, the machine ain't the king,
[03:26.220]It's the human who forgot that they're supposed to fucking think.
[03:28.745]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)
[03:31.164]Brains unplugged, let the bots run this town!
[03:33.927]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (HOW?)
[03:35.905]Everybody ships, nobody knows how!
[03:38.927]PRESS ENTER! (ENTER!)
[03:40.184]Watch the bullshit go round and round!
[03:42.136]
[03:43.424]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)
[03:45.666]The lights are on but the minds shut down!
[03:48.665]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW!
[03:50.162]
[03:53.586]SLOPOCALYPSE NOW!
[03:55.281]
[03:57.106]"Hey, this song is actually pretty good."
[03:59.283]
[04:01.068]"Thanks. An AI wrote it."
[04:02.645]"Oh. Did you check the lyrics?"
[04:03.803]
[04:05.620]"...Ship it."
[04:06.118]
